1
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:23,347
♪Where can love ever be whole?♪

2
00:00:23,372 --> 00:00:27,874
♪When will the bright moon be full?♪

3
00:00:28,268 --> 00:00:30,609
♪Love and hate turn on a single thought♪

4
00:00:30,634 --> 00:00:35,366
♪The past is hard to leave, part,
or sever♪

5
00:00:35,497 --> 00:00:38,755
♪My true heart has never changed♪

6
00:00:40,008 --> 00:00:42,699
♪I wish to become paired swallows
with you♪

7
00:00:43,518 --> 00:00:48,290
♪To meet year after year♪

8
00:00:53,205 --> 00:00:55,734
=Phoenix Rising from the Faint Moon=

9
00:00:55,759 --> 00:00:58,511
(Adapted from the Fanqie Novel
Heaven-Sent Consort & Scheming Prince)

10
00:00:58,523 --> 00:00:59,521
(Author: Yun Jinque)

11
00:01:01,052 --> 00:01:04,114
=Episode 5=

12
00:01:06,380 --> 00:01:08,019
Actually, we can go back.

13
00:01:08,139 --> 00:01:09,139
It's just a bit complicated.

14
00:01:11,740 --> 00:01:13,260
One bowl of
chicken and mushroom noodles.

15
00:01:13,260 --> 00:01:14,579
- Hurry up.
- Okay, sir.

16
00:01:15,099 --> 00:01:16,099
Please wait a moment.

17
00:01:16,860 --> 00:01:18,660
Boss, add a soft boiled egg for me.

18
00:01:21,180 --> 00:01:21,979
Are you blind?

19
00:01:22,099 --> 00:01:23,059
My noodles!

20
00:01:23,126 --> 00:01:23,419
You...

21
00:01:23,419 --> 00:01:24,260
Noodles my ass!

22
00:01:24,939 --> 00:01:25,300
You...

23
00:01:29,900 --> 00:01:31,139
This is what you get
for kicking my noodles!

24
00:01:31,139 --> 00:01:32,380
(Crazy Good Noodle House)
Are you sorry now?

25
00:01:32,380 --> 00:01:33,539
Stop!

26
00:01:33,916 --> 00:01:34,989
Why did they fight?

27
00:01:36,443 --> 00:01:37,381
This is terrifying.

28
00:01:37,979 --> 00:01:39,059
He's already dead.

29
00:01:39,459 --> 00:01:41,340
Oh my.

30
00:01:43,019 --> 00:01:45,059
Sir, here comes your noodles.

31
00:01:46,419 --> 00:01:47,700
What...

32
00:01:57,780 --> 00:01:58,700
What's the meaning of this?

33
00:01:58,900 --> 00:01:59,539
Mo Yuya,

34
00:01:59,860 --> 00:02:01,579
I opened a shop, and you have to
pick a fight?

35
00:02:06,539 --> 00:02:07,300
And he is?

36
00:02:07,300 --> 00:02:08,019
I...

37
00:02:08,139 --> 00:02:08,499
I'm...

38
00:02:08,499 --> 00:02:09,059
Him?

39
00:02:09,419 --> 00:02:11,459
He's a waiter I just hired.
What about it?

40
00:02:12,260 --> 00:02:14,459
Right, I'm the waiter she just hired.

41
00:02:14,860 --> 00:02:15,459
Him?

42
00:02:16,019 --> 00:02:17,139
A waiter?

43
00:02:17,370 --> 00:02:17,922
Right.

44
00:02:18,380 --> 00:02:19,139
Yeah.

45
00:02:19,220 --> 00:02:20,619
He's old and cheap.

46
00:02:22,340 --> 00:02:23,539
Suit yourself.

47
00:02:24,380 --> 00:02:25,660
Suit myself?

48
00:02:26,660 --> 00:02:27,459
Princess Consort,

49
00:02:27,860 --> 00:02:29,020
(Token)
I'm Yan Qi, Assistant Minister

50
00:02:29,020 --> 00:02:29,820
of the Court of Judicial Review.

51
00:02:30,939 --> 00:02:32,180
Nice to meet you, minister.

52
00:02:32,459 --> 00:02:33,300
Take him away.

53
00:02:34,380 --> 00:02:35,220
Princess Consort,

54
00:02:35,700 --> 00:02:37,459
leave the rest
to the Court of Judicial Review.

55
00:02:37,939 --> 00:02:39,780
We'll definitely give you
a satisfactory answer.

56
00:02:39,780 --> 00:02:42,220
Alright.
Then I'll leave it to you, minister.

57
00:02:42,539 --> 00:02:43,019
Rest assured.

58
00:02:43,340 --> 00:02:45,260
I'll keep this geezer
under strict watch.

59
00:02:45,499 --> 00:02:46,539
It won't happen again.

60
00:02:46,900 --> 00:02:49,780
Our shop is a law-abiding establishment.

61
00:02:51,059 --> 00:02:52,180
Take care, minister.

62
00:02:52,900 --> 00:02:53,939
I was just here.

63
00:02:53,979 --> 00:02:55,900
I just did this.

64
00:02:55,900 --> 00:02:57,220
Just this one move,

65
00:02:57,220 --> 00:02:58,300
and he stopped breathing?

66
00:02:58,900 --> 00:02:59,860
Such a big guy, and he couldn't take it.

67
00:02:59,860 --> 00:03:00,820
Ye!

68
00:03:01,059 --> 00:03:02,220
The moment you transmigrate,

69
00:03:02,220 --> 00:03:03,380
you have to break the law? Why?

70
00:03:03,820 --> 00:03:04,419
Do you know

71
00:03:04,419 --> 00:03:06,860
the person you just killed might be
from an assassin organization?

72
00:03:07,780 --> 00:03:08,660
Boss,

73
00:03:08,660 --> 00:03:10,099
I didn't want this either.

74
00:03:10,380 --> 00:03:12,139
I found that
after I became a beggar here,

75
00:03:12,660 --> 00:03:13,979
I became a martial arts master.

76
00:03:14,220 --> 00:03:15,820
I just did this,

77
00:03:15,900 --> 00:03:17,340
and he dropped dead.

78
00:03:17,780 --> 00:03:18,780
What?

79
00:03:18,979 --> 00:03:20,459
One move and he died?

80
00:03:20,939 --> 00:03:22,300
You don't believe me?

81
00:03:23,099 --> 00:03:24,220
Let me prove it to you.

82
00:03:24,900 --> 00:03:26,220
I'll prove it to you.

83
00:03:26,419 --> 00:03:27,340
Watch.

84
00:03:30,059 --> 00:03:31,019
See that?

85
00:03:42,019 --> 00:03:43,099
That's how strong I am.

86
00:03:45,059 --> 00:03:46,059
Amazing.

87
00:03:46,059 --> 00:03:47,300
I'd love to keep a low profile too,

88
00:03:47,300 --> 00:03:49,900
but my strength won't allow it.

89
00:03:52,700 --> 00:03:54,860
(Since Ye has these skills,)

90
00:03:55,499 --> 00:03:57,900
(I can show my cards to Feng Qingyun.)

91
00:04:00,139 --> 00:04:01,139
- Who is this guy?
- Who is this guy?

92
00:04:02,059 --> 00:04:03,099
The top dog.

93
00:04:03,740 --> 00:04:04,619
Call me "boss".

94
00:04:05,700 --> 00:04:06,820
Let's go, top dog.

95
00:04:07,459 --> 00:04:08,579
Hey, boss.

96
00:04:10,220 --> 00:04:11,300
Don't worry, go ahead.

97
00:04:17,099 --> 00:04:18,099
Feng Qingyun!

98
00:04:20,300 --> 00:04:21,419
Feng Qingyun!

99
00:04:24,340 --> 00:04:27,260
Feng Qingyun!

100
00:04:30,459 --> 00:04:32,220
Weiyue, why are you here again?

101
00:04:34,900 --> 00:04:35,900
Who is this man?

102
00:04:36,340 --> 00:04:37,059
The top dog.

103
00:04:38,180 --> 00:04:38,820
Feng Qingyun,

104
00:04:39,180 --> 00:04:40,180
I already told you

105
00:04:40,380 --> 00:04:41,579
to give me some time.

106
00:04:41,700 --> 00:04:42,900
And you're so impatient

107
00:04:42,900 --> 00:04:44,660
that you sent Xingzhao Pavilion
to take my life?

108
00:04:46,099 --> 00:04:48,860
If you're going to
play the innocent girl, act like one.

109
00:04:49,099 --> 00:04:50,380
With a temper like that,

110
00:04:50,740 --> 00:04:52,780
you won't hold the spot
of his perfect first love.

111
00:04:53,300 --> 00:04:54,619
His perfect first love?

112
00:04:54,700 --> 00:04:56,059
The innocent girl?

113
00:04:56,059 --> 00:04:57,780
What nonsense are you talking about,
Weiyue?

114
00:04:58,300 --> 00:04:58,979
I don't understand.

115
00:04:59,860 --> 00:05:00,939
Understand it or not, I don't care.

116
00:05:01,419 --> 00:05:02,139
Listen up.

117
00:05:02,300 --> 00:05:03,579
You can send them to kill me again,

118
00:05:03,660 --> 00:05:04,860
but I'm warning you,

119
00:05:05,260 --> 00:05:06,660
once I get my hands on you,

120
00:05:06,660 --> 00:05:08,019
you're dead.

121
00:05:18,340 --> 00:05:19,820
Let's go, top dog.

122
00:05:22,059 --> 00:05:23,579
What is wrong with Xingzhao Pavilion?

123
00:05:23,700 --> 00:05:26,046
You call yourselves the top
assassin organization in Yinbei,

124
00:05:26,340 --> 00:05:27,780
and you can't even handle one woman?

125
00:05:28,260 --> 00:05:30,139
Don't be so quick to anger,
Miss Feng Qingyun.

126
00:05:30,539 --> 00:05:32,459
There's something strange
about this woman.

127
00:05:33,220 --> 00:05:34,619
What's so strange about her?

128
00:05:34,900 --> 00:05:37,419
Could a boy-crazy woman be omnipotent?

129
00:05:38,220 --> 00:05:40,579
Two failed attempts in a row.

130
00:05:41,780 --> 00:05:43,820
I think your Xingzhao Pavilion

131
00:05:44,059 --> 00:05:46,380
is all talk.

132
00:05:47,019 --> 00:05:48,619
Xingzhao Pavilion always
finishes the job.

133
00:05:49,260 --> 00:05:51,539
This failure has already alerted
our Guardian.

134
00:05:51,820 --> 00:05:53,539
Next time he will act personally.

135
00:05:53,539 --> 00:05:56,059
He'll definitely give you
a satisfactory answer.

136
00:06:00,619 --> 00:06:02,860
Hey, when is next time?

137
00:06:05,660 --> 00:06:07,220
(Ming Zhao, Xingzhao Pavilion Guardian)
What kind of woman

138
00:06:07,539 --> 00:06:09,939
could make Xingzhao Pavilion
fail again and again?

139
00:06:11,459 --> 00:06:12,579
Guardian,

140
00:06:13,419 --> 00:06:15,780
that woman is nothing special.

141
00:06:16,139 --> 00:06:17,459
Just a little stronger than most.

142
00:06:17,900 --> 00:06:19,380
But she has an expert by her side.

143
00:06:20,820 --> 00:06:22,539
The second one we lost

144
00:06:22,539 --> 00:06:23,459
was a Heaven-ranked assassin.

145
00:06:23,900 --> 00:06:25,539
From the state of his body,

146
00:06:26,019 --> 00:06:27,939
he must have encountered

147
00:06:27,939 --> 00:06:29,059
an overwhelmingly powerful enemy.

148
00:06:29,419 --> 00:06:30,340
Is that so?

149
00:06:31,019 --> 00:06:33,419
This was taken from his body.

150
00:06:35,059 --> 00:06:38,900
Before he died, he left information
about his killer.

151
00:06:41,099 --> 00:06:43,260
The one who killed him

152
00:06:43,979 --> 00:06:46,220
was actually that man.

153
00:06:46,245 --> 00:06:47,836
(Letter)

154
00:06:47,860 --> 00:06:50,340
Judging by the moves, it should be
someone from Xingyun Sect.

155
00:06:51,459 --> 00:06:55,380
To kill a Heaven-ranked assassin
of Xingzhao Pavilion in an instant,

156
00:06:56,019 --> 00:06:57,099
I'm afraid

157
00:06:57,740 --> 00:06:59,539
only the Sect Master of Xingyun Sect
could do it.

158
00:07:00,459 --> 00:07:01,459
Not long ago,

159
00:07:01,700 --> 00:07:03,380
Court of Judicial Review spies learned

160
00:07:03,619 --> 00:07:04,979
that due to internal strife
in Xingyun Sect,

161
00:07:05,340 --> 00:07:07,300
their Sect Master has been missing
for some time.

162
00:07:09,419 --> 00:07:10,700
Could she

163
00:07:11,300 --> 00:07:12,939
actually have some connection

164
00:07:14,180 --> 00:07:15,260
with Xingyun Sect?

165
00:07:16,380 --> 00:07:18,300
The princess consort seems unaware
of the old man's identity.

166
00:07:19,419 --> 00:07:20,979
So I think

167
00:07:21,340 --> 00:07:24,619
she and this Ye guy
simply share the same temperament

168
00:07:24,619 --> 00:07:25,740
and hit it off at first sight.

169
00:07:29,300 --> 00:07:31,059
Ye Yuntian suddenly appeared
during the day

170
00:07:32,300 --> 00:07:33,900
and ruined our arrest plan.

171
00:07:34,860 --> 00:07:36,619
Whether it was coincidence
or intentional

172
00:07:37,340 --> 00:07:38,619
is still unknown.

173
00:07:40,380 --> 00:07:41,860
The situation isn't clear yet.

174
00:07:42,579 --> 00:07:43,539
It's better

175
00:07:44,939 --> 00:07:46,700
to wait and see.

176
00:07:47,700 --> 00:07:48,539
Understood.

177
00:07:54,499 --> 00:07:55,499
Mother,

178
00:07:55,499 --> 00:07:56,579
what brings you here?

179
00:07:57,939 --> 00:07:59,740
I should be asking you that.

180
00:08:00,180 --> 00:08:01,539
My precious daughter-in-law

181
00:08:01,539 --> 00:08:02,700
has only been back a few days.

182
00:08:02,700 --> 00:08:04,419
I haven't even seen her,
and she's gone again?

183
00:08:05,300 --> 00:08:06,499
Where is she?

184
00:08:12,220 --> 00:08:13,300
Where is Feng Weiyue?

185
00:08:17,660 --> 00:08:20,099
The princess consort said something
came up at home and just left.

186
00:08:21,860 --> 00:08:22,780
Silly boy,

187
00:08:23,179 --> 00:08:24,500
you don't care about Weiyue at all.

188
00:08:25,500 --> 00:08:26,540
Go there yourself.

189
00:08:26,820 --> 00:08:27,860
See how Weiyue is doing

190
00:08:27,860 --> 00:08:29,259
and see if she needs any help.

191
00:08:30,099 --> 00:08:31,460
Bring her back to me soon.

192
00:08:33,979 --> 00:08:35,620
Yes, Mother.

193
00:08:52,500 --> 00:08:55,339
Madam Bai took this fall
down the stairs.

194
00:08:55,379 --> 00:08:56,500
The injury is quite serious.

195
00:08:56,740 --> 00:08:57,620
I'm afraid the child...

196
00:08:57,620 --> 00:08:59,219
Doctor, please.

197
00:09:00,219 --> 00:09:02,540
Please save my child.

198
00:09:02,939 --> 00:09:04,900
I'm begging you, doctor.

199
00:09:05,339 --> 00:09:06,219
Grand Tutor,

200
00:09:06,299 --> 00:09:08,540
there's nothing I can do,
so I'll take my leave.

201
00:09:14,099 --> 00:09:15,979
This is the only male heir

202
00:09:16,500 --> 00:09:18,019
in my family.

203
00:09:18,580 --> 00:09:21,019
Dear, there will be more
in the future.

204
00:09:21,500 --> 00:09:23,620
Even if Madam Bai's belly fails,

205
00:09:23,620 --> 00:09:24,939
there's still mine.

206
00:09:25,740 --> 00:09:27,179
That's right, Madam Bai.

207
00:09:27,179 --> 00:09:28,620
Don't be too heartbroken.

208
00:09:28,979 --> 00:09:30,299
The child is gone, and that's that.

209
00:09:30,540 --> 00:09:31,540
Your health matters more.

210
00:09:31,540 --> 00:09:32,900
It's not a big deal to you

211
00:09:32,900 --> 00:09:34,259
because you know nothing about
the pain of pregnancy.

212
00:09:36,379 --> 00:09:36,740
Mother.

213
00:09:36,740 --> 00:09:37,460
Weiyue.

214
00:09:38,540 --> 00:09:39,259
Are you all right?

215
00:09:39,259 --> 00:09:40,820
Weiyue, it's my fault.

216
00:09:43,460 --> 00:09:45,339
It's all my fault.

217
00:09:46,339 --> 00:09:47,620
Yuya.

218
00:09:58,179 --> 00:09:58,900
Well?

219
00:10:02,059 --> 00:10:03,740
The child can still be saved.

220
00:10:20,650 --> 00:10:23,708
♪Dazzling my eyes, impossible to clear♪

221
00:10:23,990 --> 00:10:26,359
♪Mist and clouds lock the frosty sky♪

222
00:10:27,967 --> 00:10:30,411
♪Moon waxes and wanes,
true and false blur♪

223
00:10:30,805 --> 00:10:33,256
♪Coming near, then drifting far♪

224
00:10:34,219 --> 00:10:37,158
♪My heart knows it three thousand times♪

225
00:10:37,650 --> 00:10:40,290
♪Flowers mirrored in clear
shallow water♪

226
00:10:40,969 --> 00:10:45,540
♪Black hair spinning a cocoon,
I step toward love's abyss♪

227
00:10:48,434 --> 00:10:50,790
♪Sword in hand, I spur my horse on♪

228
00:10:51,490 --> 00:10:53,810
♪Love and duty cannot both be whole♪

229
00:10:55,351 --> 00:10:57,915
♪Troubles within and without,
home and realm in peril♪

230
00:10:58,358 --> 00:11:00,540
♪Scattered before my eyes♪

231
00:11:01,816 --> 00:11:04,651
♪Wind and snow cannot blow away
my longing♪

232
00:11:05,191 --> 00:11:07,540
♪Letting go is a kind of fulfillment♪

233
00:11:08,076 --> 00:11:09,403
♪This love remains unchanged♪

234
00:11:09,428 --> 00:11:12,540
♪Yet under the moon I make empty wishes♪

235
00:11:14,545 --> 00:11:17,010
♪Ask not of love's poison,
yearning cannot be cut♪

236
00:11:17,131 --> 00:11:21,110
♪In the mortal world jade shatters,
tears of blood run dry♪

237
00:11:21,488 --> 00:11:22,863
♪Ask again of love's poison,
in whose arms will I sleep♪

238
00:11:24,149 --> 00:11:25,868
♪How can I bear a sweet dream♪

239
00:11:25,868 --> 00:11:27,540
♪Turning into doom♪
(Wedding)

240
00:11:28,323 --> 00:11:30,916
♪A path full of thorns,
time won't wait♪

241
00:11:30,941 --> 00:11:35,069
♪I fear this life won't grant us
tender days together♪

242
00:11:35,657 --> 00:11:37,626
♪I don't regret that vow♪

243
00:11:37,650 --> 00:11:41,081
♪Luckily, the phoenix has fallen
into my heart♪
